            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مورخ (movarrekh) ها درباره این جنگ زیاد نوشته اند. Movarrekh-hâ darbâre-ye in jang ziyâd neveshte-and. Historians have written a lot about this war."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also plural movarrekhân. The same Arabic root gives târikh \"history\"."
            }
          ]
        },
